# Clojure tools-deps caches and compiled output. These must NOT be tracked:
# they are machine/checkout-specific and get dirtied by runs, which otherwise
# leaves the protogen submodule perpetually "modified" in the superproject.
#
# .cpcache/ is a per-run classpath cache. target/ is NOT regenerated per run:
# target/classes holds the AOT bytecode the docs legs load, minted once by
# aot.sh and kept until its input hash moves. Deleting it costs one recompile,
# never correctness.
.cpcache/
target/
.nrepl-port
